skilletor: r1@shared is not declared explicitly; it is installed by the bundles bundle:perl@shared, bundle:go@shared in the user config. To drop it, uninstall the bundle (skilletor uninstall 'bundle:perl@shared' or skilletor uninstall 'bundle:go@shared'), or keep it and gate the item via vars if its template renders empty for some value (an empty render is skipped).
